From 678db547b56c6f776257887d86810096fe8945fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baverrr <342259467+baverrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:15:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] EchoParts: Use the glass Settings theme

Show the Microphone processing, Bluetooth audio and Camera shutter
pages like the RavenOS glass Settings: a soft gradient backdrop with
transparent bars, each preference group drawn as one rounded glass card
with hairline separators in a centred column (GlassListView), quiet
section headings, and dialogs on a solid surface.

Every color comes from res/values/settings_glass.xml, so a product
overlay can recolor the pages to match the device's Settings theme.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
